(text "Plug-in carrier: every module sits on sockets. Nets join by label name." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 238.76 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "8de8aa25-c7e7-56c2-a085-70edb11cbf58"))
(text "ArduSimple: male headers soldered underneath; power switch DOWN (5V IN, IOREF N/C); --role rover (UART2 off)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 243.84 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "a7a59ccc-3c65-5099-8959-4e42a20bec67"))
(text "Feather plugs in display side up, USB-C at the front edge. LIS3DH runs from VSYS (its own 3.3 V regulator)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 248.92 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "6a05d152-3ee7-56eb-b87f-cf4c3118ba43"))
(text "bq24074 optional: fitted -> JP1 open, battery feeds the charger, charger OUT feeds VSYS." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 254.00 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "7a15512d-1401-5047-b4c7-4efe67e05294"))
(text "No bq24074 -> fit the JP1 shunt (BATT to VSYS). Never both: the shunt would bypass the charger." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 259.08 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "6d90d5b8-4681-55b8-ac86-b8d8f8e4c97c"))
(text "~CHG and ~PGOOD are open drain to Feather D11 / D12 (read with INPUT_PULLUP); the firmware does not use them yet." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 264.16 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "ff2ba986-13f4-54a9-975e-d4a5da12259d"))
(text "Optional, unused by the firmware so far: TIMEPULSE -> A1, EXTINT <- A2, bq ~CE <- A3 (high stops charging; 10k pull-down on the bq), LIS3DH INT2 -> A4." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 269.24 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "23ba9286-96fb-55c9-9591-d7357cbce7d5"))
(text "GPS_EN: Feather A0 to pad TP2; wire TP2 to the S9V11F5 EN hole. Build with -DGPS_POWER_PIN=18 to cut the GPS and XBee in deep sleep." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "95e57b23-14cc-5c9a-8378-4d1721fecc7f"))
(text "J12: short EN to GND to switch the Feather off (the regulator and ArduSimple stay on battery power)." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 30.48 279.40 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left)) (uuid "222c057f-ab10-5a21-9ce1-8eb38e104e95"))
